{
  "schema": "pelican.studio_scenario",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "gui_build_music",
  "description": "GB-4 target 2 (music), from File > New Project > Blank with Studio's GUI only. A short quiet WAV is put in the project's assets/audio (a file step, as a person copies a file in; 8-bit PCM whose every byte is ASCII, so the step's text write is byte-exact, about -24 dBFS, 2 s). The palette's audio.playback arrives on that sound and on the scene clock (Q-10 / Q-11); Bus and Wrap are picked with the keyboard (bgm, repeat). The scenario is silent (the driver names the null backend, get_status audio says so); whether the voice runs is read from its published value (get_graph_node_values: audio_playback.voice is the voice's elapsed seconds): 0 in edit, it runs with Play and equals the scene clock, it stands still while paused, and Stop puts it back to 0. The Timeline needs an owned instance in Values from even for root nodes, so an empty definition (Add loop) is attached to MainCamera only to give the strip a source; with Live on, a press at the strip's left end while paused moves the scene clock back and the voice with it. Typed: the project folder and name, audio.playback in the palette's filter.",
  "tab": "frame_plan",
  "probe_no_automation": false,
  "steps": [
    {"label": "the fixture's engine is up", "cmd": "wait_engine", "timeout_ms": 180000},
    {"label": "File > New Project...", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.file.newProject"},
    {"label": "the dialog is on screen", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.newProjectDialog", "timeout_ms": 10000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the folder: this run's own artifacts", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.newProject.location", "text": "{artifacts}"},
    {"label": "the name", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.newProject.name", "text": "gb_music"},
    {"label": "the Blank pipeline template", "cmd": "select", "name": "pelican.newProject.template", "text": "Blank pipeline"},
    {"label": "Create", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.newProject.create"},
    {"label": "the dialog closed", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.newProjectDialog", "timeout_ms": 10000, "missing": true},
    {"label": "the blank project's present is on the Frame Plan canvas", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.framePlanLogicalView::node#present", "timeout_ms": 180000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the new engine answers and has presented frames", "cmd": "wait_engine", "timeout_ms": 180000, "frames": 30},
    {"label": "the Graph tab is in front", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.view.renderTools.graph"},
    {"label": "the canvas can edit the new document", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "put a short quiet WAV in the project (8-bit, every byte ASCII so a text write is byte-exact)", "file": "write", "path": "{artifacts}/gb_music/assets/audio/pulse.wav", "text": "RIFF$>\u0000\u0000WAVEfmt \u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0000\u0001\u0000@\u001f\u0000\u0000@\u001f\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0000\b\u0000data\u0000>\u0000\u0000vwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxwutrqpoonnnnoopqstuwxyz||}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}~~~~~}|{zywvusrqpoonnnnopqrstvwxz{|}}~~~~}||zyxwutsqpoonnnnoopqrtuwxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zxwvtsrqponnnnoopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopqrstuwxz{|}}~~~~}}|{yxwutsrpponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{zywvusrqponnnnnopqrsuvwyz{|}}~~~~}|{zyxvutrqpoonnnnopprstuwxy{|}}~~~~}}|{zxwutsrqponnnnoopqrtuvxyz{|}~~~~}}|{"},
    {"label": "Show: Value", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasShow.value"},
    {"label": "Show: Audio", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasShow.audio"},
    {"label": "Add: the palette opens (audio.playback)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode"},
    {"label": "the palette is on screen", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPalette", "timeout_ms": 10000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the filter: audio.playback", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "text": "audio.playback"},
    {"label": "Enter in the filter is OK", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "sequence": "Return"},
    {"label": "the palette closed", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPalette", "timeout_ms": 10000, "missing": true},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "the voice plays the project's sound", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[1].parameters.asset", "value": "project://assets/audio/pulse.wav", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "on the scene clock the palette put beside it", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[0].parameters.name", "value": "scene_time"},
    {"label": "its time is that clock", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[1].inputs.time.node", "value": "scene_time"},
    {"label": "auto layout (the new nodes lie over present)", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.autoLayout"},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 1000, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "fit", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"},
    {"label": "pick the voice", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#audio_playback"},
    {"label": "its Sound / Bus / Wrap fields", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioRow", "timeout_ms": 30000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "Sound names the WAV", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioAsset", "timeout_ms": 30000, "text": "project://assets/audio/pulse.wav"},
    {"label": "Bus: one down (se -> bgm), from the keyboard", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioBus", "sequence": "Down"},
    {"label": "bus bgm", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[1].parameters.bus", "value": "bgm", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 1000, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "Wrap: one down (once -> repeat)", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioWrap", "sequence": "Down"},
    {"label": "wrap repeat", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[1].parameters.wrap", "value": "repeat", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 1000, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "Add loop (the only way to a new definition)", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.addLoop"},
    {"label": "the loop's zone", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_zone#loop", "timeout_ms": 120000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "pick MainCamera", "cmd": "select", "name": "pelican.outliner", "text": "MainCamera"},
    {"label": "Attach is usable", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphAttach", "timeout_ms": 60000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "Attach...", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphAttach"},
    {"label": "the dialog", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphAttachmentDialog", "timeout_ms": 20000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "Definition: loop_body", "cmd": "select", "name": "pelican.graphDefinition", "text": "loop_body"},
    {"label": "Attach and save", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphAttachSave"},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphNotice", "timeout_ms": 60000, "contains": "saved"},
    {"label": "the Graph tab", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.view.renderTools.graph"},
    {"label": "Refresh", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasRefresh"},
    {"label": "the instance is drawn", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#loop_body_1", "timeout_ms": 60000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the scenario is silent: the null backend", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_status", "params": {}, "path": "audio.backend", "value": "null"},
    {"label": "edit: the voice has not moved", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[0].outputs.voice", "value": 0, "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "Values from: the instance", "cmd": "select", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasValues", "text": "loop_body_1"},
    {"label": "fit", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"},
    {"label": "pick the voice", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#audio_playback"},
    {"label": "Timeline", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimelineToggle"},
    {"label": "the strip", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "timeout_ms": 20000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "Live", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLive"},
    {"label": "the strip reads the voice", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphTimelineSummary", "timeout_ms": 60000, "contains": "audio_playback.voice"},
    {"label": "press Play", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.play.play"},
    {"label": "playing", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.playStatus", "timeout_ms": 30000, "contains": "Playing"},
    {"label": "playing: the voice runs", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[0].outputs.voice", "op": "gt", "value": 1.0, "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "press Pause", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.play.pause"},
    {"label": "paused", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.playStatus", "timeout_ms": 10000, "contains": "Paused"},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 1000, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "paused, read the voice", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[0].outputs.voice", "remember": "voice_paused"},
    {"label": "60 frames paused (read)", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_status", "params": {}}, "path": "result.frame", "remember": "_delay1"},
    {"label": "60 frames paused", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_status", "params": {}}, "path": "result.frame", "op": "ge", "value_of": "_delay1", "plus": 60, "retry_ms": 120000},
    {"label": "paused: the voice stands still", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[0].outputs.voice", "value_of": "voice_paused"},
    {"label": "paused: the voice is at the scene clock", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[1].outputs.value", "value_of": "voice_paused"},
    {"label": "scrub: a press at the strip's left end", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "point": [3, 40]},
    {"label": "the voice went back with the scene clock", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[0].outputs.voice", "op": "lt", "value_of": "voice_paused", "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "the scrubbed voice, read", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[0].outputs.voice", "remember": "voice_scrubbed"},
    {"label": "and it is the scene clock the strip set", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}}, "path": "result.nodes[1].outputs.value", "value_of": "voice_scrubbed"},
    {"label": "the strip names the voice it follows", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphTimelineSummary", "timeout_ms": 10000, "contains": "audio_playback.voice"},
    {"label": "a picture of the window (paused, scrubbed)", "expect": "screenshot", "path": "gui_build_music_window.png"},
    {"label": "Live off", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLive"},
    {"label": "press Stop", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.play.play"},
    {"label": "edit again", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.playStatus", "timeout_ms": 30000, "text": "Edit"},
    {"label": "stopped: the voice is back at 0", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[0].outputs.voice", "value": 0, "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "a picture of the Graph tab", "expect": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas", "path": "gui_build_music_graph.png"}
  ]
}
